<!--
    Based on the stock vendor/etc/vintf/manifest.xml, with:
      - target-level raised from 5 to 7.  The lowest kernel FCM a 4.19 kernel
        may use is 6, so checkvintf rejects 5 with "first kernel FCM version
        allowed for kernel version 4.19.y is 6".
      - <kernel target-level="5"/> dropped, left to the build.
      - the <sepolicy> block dropped, it conflicts with BOARD_SEPOLICY_VERS.
      - HAL declarations with no entry in the framework compatibility matrix
        dropped: android.hardware.neuralnetworks, android.hardware.memtrack@1.0,
        vendor.semc.hardware.thermal@1.1, vendor.somc.hardware.superstamina@1.0
        and vendor.somc.hardware.wifidriver@2.1.
-->
